  "description": {
   "en": "The greatest chef in Korean history, Hong Si-won, has passed away suddenly.\nHis final will shocked everyone — he decreed that all the chefs in his restaurant must compete for the position of head chef.\n\nInto this fierce competition steps a young man with the “Tongue of God,” Park Geon-woo.\nCan he survive the brutal battleground of \"Beauty and Jade\", where no one can be trusted?\n\nA fiery culinary showdown filled with passion and growth, friendship and rivalry.\nWho will emerge as the final victor?"
  },
